# Unreal build output and caches
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
*.sln
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.suo
*.xcworkspace
# files the Claude desktop app drops here when Claude sends one in the chat
Claude outputs/
# Bought packs (Fab) stay on this PC: they run to gigabytes, and git should only get what the game ends up using.
# The game's own assets go in Content/CrystalVein, which is tracked. A fresh clone runs without the packs: Kit.txt skips
# what is not there and draws the grey boxes.
/Content/*
!/Content/CrystalVein/
